LrK7getQcdGRUF0YIBIX0Gyg&oe=6A04968E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 bas(2).png", "id": "1047063833905445", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391781_1047063837238778_7496786514780933794_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6uYTeA_0jnUQ7kNvwFQzrwo&_nc_oc=AdravClwLwBuN4KXQvMudO6M11zs-sCu-jmrahIiDmcRNXeaAo-RvEeSatsrFyBdaKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4bACLEVD62pdPx-5O--CV0Y9Wdf4C71nCjI7I_PC7F0g&oe=6A04932A"}, "display_name": "Play Five: Ultimate Basketball", "keywords": ["basketball", "dunk", "sport", "fitness", "hoops"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfc0 **VR Basketball Like You\u2019ve Never Played Before**\n\nStep onto the court and take full control of your team in an immersive basketball experience built entirely for VR. Play offline, master your skills, customize everything, and lead your squad to championship glory \u2014 all from inside the game.\n\nWhether you want fast arcade action or serious league competition, this game delivers fun, freedom, and full control over how basketball feels in VR.\n\n---\n\ud83d\udd25 **Game Modes**\n- **Quick Match** \u2013 Jump straight into action by choosing home and visiting teams  \n- **League** \u2013 Compete across a season and win trophies  \n- **Tournament** \u2013 Battle selected teams in knockout-style competition  \n- **Training** \u2013 Learn dribbling, shooting, movement, and dunking\n- **Ball Smasher** \u2013 Arcade mini-game for pure fun  \n\n---\n\ud83c\udfae **Deep Gameplay & Customization**\n- Full **team and player management**\n- Edit outfits, logos, team names, player names, bodies, faces, and hairstyles \n- Customize **all 50 teams** in the game \u2014 play against your dream lineups  \n- Tons of **gameplay settings** to tailor the experience  \n- Add **fun hats** and visual flair to players  \n- Choose between **manual or automatic dribbling**  \n- **Assisted or precise shooting** modes  \n- **Slow motion**, **commentary**, **fire balls**, and **score effects** for epic moments  \n\n---\n\ud83c\udfc6 **Progress & Achievements**\n- Unlock **20+ stylish achievements** with collectible badges  \n---\n\ud83c\udf0d **Locations**\n- **Arena** \u2013 Classic indoor stadium atmosphere  \n- **City** \u2013 Outdoor games with optional rain effects  \n", "short_description": "Take full control of your team in an immersive VR basketball experience you can play completely offline. Jump into quick matches, compete in leagues and tournaments, train your skills, or enjoy arcade-style mini game. Customize your players, teams, outfits, logos, and even all 50 teams in the game. Choose between assisted or precise shooting, manual or automatic dribbling, activate slow motion, fire balls, score effects, and commentary for epic moments. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bb_v3.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": "https://basketball.artisoft.pl/support.html", "website_url": "https://basketball.artisoft.pl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26903693565882464"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391716_12927721018